{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00551","headline":"郊庙歌辞 禅社首乐章 太和 · 贺知章、源乾曜","name":"郊庙歌辞 禅社首乐章 太和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昭昭有唐，天俾万国。\n列祖应命，四宗顺则。\n申锡无疆，宗我同德。\n曾孙继序，享神配极。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贺知章、源乾曜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00551.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00551","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}